One family's journey from Down Under to center stage.

2
00:12:33,333 --> 00:12:39,333
Unsung Hero is a drama, music, family film directed by Richard Ramsey.

3
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:56,000
When David Smallbone's successful music company collapses, he moves his family
from Australia to the United States in search of a brighter future.

4
00:25:06,666 --> 00:25:12,666
With nothing more than their six children, their suitcases, and their love of music, David
and his pregnant wife Helen set out to rebuild their lives from the ground up.

5
00:31:23,333 --> 00:31:29,333
Based on a remarkable true story, a mum's faith stands against all odds;
and inspires her husband and children to hold onto theirs.

6
