01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:26,000
Unsung Hero is a 2024 American Christian drama film written and
directed by Richard Ramsey and Joel Smallbone.

13
01:21:36,666 --> 01:21:42,666
It follows Rebecca, Joel, and Luke Smallbone of For King & Country and
their life journey to become Christian recording artists.

14
